# Context trim for the terminal build ONLY (BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore — the root
# .dockerignore still governs meeting-api's root-context build). Whitelist: the pnpm
# workspace skeleton + the terminal app. Everything else in the repo stays out.
*
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!package.json
!core/**/package.json
!clients/terminal/**
clients/terminal/node_modules/
clients/terminal/.next/
clients/terminal/.turbo/
